### ==============================================================
### Laboratory Work No. 6: Forms, Validation, i18n & Exception Handling
### ==============================================================

### 1. Open form in English
GET http://localhost:8080/books/new?lang=en

### 2. Open form in Russian
GET http://localhost:8080/books/new?lang=ru

### 3. Submit empty form (fails validation on all required fields)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### 4. Submit form with invalid year and no genre
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java Concurrency&author=Brian Goetz&year=1200

### 5. Submit form with author containing digits (violates @NoDigits)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Effective Java&author=Bloch 2018&year=2018&genre=SCIENCE

### 6. Variant 2: Class-level constraint violation (reprintYear < year)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Clean Architecture&author=Robert Martin&year=2020&reprintYear=2010&genre=NON_FICTION

### 7. Successful submission (redirects to /books with flash message)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Clean Architecture&author=Robert Martin&year=2020&reprintYear=2022&genre=NON_FICTION&available=true

### 8. Exception handling for Page: GET /books/999 -> returns HTML template error/not-found
GET http://localhost:8080/books/999
Accept: text/html

### 9. Exception handling for API: GET /api/books/999 -> returns RFC 7807/9457 ProblemDetail JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Accept: application/json
